    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "If a fee is payable under this Act, then the Commonwealth is liable to pay it.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) The Commonwealth is not liable to pay a fee that is payable under this Act to a part of the Commonwealth that is not a separate legal entity.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "However, it is the Parliament’s intention that the Commonwealth should be notionally liable to pay such a fee.";
